)S IPCSDDIR                                                             00000145
)F FUNCTION -                                                           00000245
   PREPARES A DUMP DIRECTORY DATA SET FOR USE IN DUMP ANALYSIS.         00000345
   IT SHOULD ONLY BE USED WHEN THE DUMP DIRECTORY DATA SET IS           00000445
   FIRST ALLOCATED. IPCSDDIR CAN BE USED AS A TSO COMMAND OR AS AN      00000545
   IPCS SUBCOMMAND.                                                     00000645
                                                                        00000745
)X SYNTAX                                                               00000845
   IPCSDDIR    'DSN'                                                    00000945
                                                                        00001045
)O OPERANDS -                                                           00001145
  'DSN'- DATA SET NAME                                                  00001245
   DSN SPECIFIES THE NAME OF THE DUMP DIRECTORY TO BE LOADED AND        00001345
   PREPARED. IF A FULLY QUALIFIED NAME IS NOT SPECIFIED, THE            00001445
   SUBCOMMAND QUALIFIES IT AS 'TSO_LOGON_ID'.DSN .                      00001545
                                                                        00001645
   REQUIRED - YES                                                       00001745
   DEFAULT  - NONE                                                      00001845
